      "blurb": "Overzealous civilian who idolizes Commander Shepard.",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Conrad Verner is a well-meaning but hopelessly out-of-his-depth fan of Commander Shepard, forever convinced he's destined to be a hero (or a Spectre) himself. He owns exactly one pistol, holds it wrong, and means extraordinarily well. He is far more dangerous to himself than to anyone else.</p><p><strong>In Over His Head:</strong> Conrad is off-guard whenever he makes an attack roll. He'd really rather talk this out.</p>",
